      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹5.00 (vs ₹4.53 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.00 (up from ₹4.53 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹185.2b (up 20% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹45.2b (up 15% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 24% (down from 25% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 32% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 10% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
